01:35:47,142 --> 01:35:53,142
Pope Joan (German: Die Päpstin) is a 2009 epic historical drama film produced by Bernd Eichinger, based on
American novelist Donna Woolfolk Cross' novel of the same name about the legendary Pope Joan.

10
01:46:25,714 --> 01:46:31,714
Directed by Sönke Wortmann, it stars Johanna Wokalek as Joan, David Wenham
as Gerold, her lover, and John Goodman as Pope Sergius II.

11
01:57:04,285 --> 01:57:10,285
The film's world premiere occurred in Berlin on 19 October 2009, with
its general release in Germany on 22 October 2009.

12
